note bridge-strict-v1 snapshot consistency only. Counts and nonzero generation
note tokens come from the trusted future whole-graph adapter/manifest owner.
note Returns 0 admit, 1 empty, 2 missing/extra nodes, 3 stale graph, 4 stale storage.
note Equal tokens do not authenticate topology, coverage, lifetime or placement.
fn strictsnapshot observed ulong expected ulong graph ulong currentgraph ulong residency ulong currentresidency ulong to ulong
if or eq observed 0 eq expected 0
ret 1
end
if ne observed expected
ret 2
end
if or eq graph 0 ne graph currentgraph
ret 3
end
if or eq residency 0 ne residency currentresidency
ret 4
end
ret 0
end
